			"notes": "- Fixed various problems from the previous test build\n\n## Added new Commands\n\n`/stagger [entities] [amount +/-] [bypassArmor]`\n`/sanity [entities] [amount +/-]`\n`/fillLight [entities] [entities]`\n`/chargeLight [entities] [amount +/-] [chargeFX]`\n\n`/incrementStatus [entities] [potency] [count] [effect]`\n`/decrementStatus [entities] [potency] [count] [effect]`\n\n## Added Blood Effects (Players Only)\n\nPlayers now accumulate blood on their player model as they take damage.\n\nThis effect is currently hardlocked to \"Compatibility\" mode to make it compatible with oculus and such. \"Performance\" and \"Off\" mode will be added via config before the final release.\n\nWhile there is no reason this blood effect *wouldn't* work on non players. It's limited to players for performance reasons for now until a config is implemented to allow for more control.\n\n> *\"It seems that other departments wear their cuts and bruises like medals. A most meaningless posturing. In our department… survival alone is more than enough of a recognition.\"*"
		}
